{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the seedy underbelly of Bailecitt\u00e0, the line between thief and private investigator is as clear as the fog that blankets the streets and factories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Sadmuc, a freelance \u201cBaffler\u201d. Few of the electronic surveillance systems and safeguards throughout this city can stand up to your custom EMP railgun. But shooting them from a distance doesn\u2019t get <i>you</i> past them. Your entire job is to get somebody <i>else</i> past those hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when it comes to sniffing around the Borflaw corporation's facilities in the sealed-off Bonglesticks area, the only person you can rely on for that is your old partner, Rania. If she can put up with you long enough, you might just be able to get to the heart of whatever Borflaw is up to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462150/extras/27c5f5a68dab37e3eab85a00238c170d.avif?t=1768844896\" alt=\"Planning before the mission: buttons to view the target, cycle start and exit positions.\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462150/extras_big/27c5f5a68dab37e3eab85a00238c170d.avif?t=1768844896 width=800 height=450 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense, tactical gameplay where success or failure relies on your aim.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple starting locations, allowing you multiple options from which to provide overwatch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guards that will not stop searching when they know an intruder is nearby.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462150/extras/74f2e92d555d0cdb4081236cf583b176.avif?t=1768844896\" alt=\"Peering over the player&#039;s gun sights during a foggy night in an abandoned city. Their night vision goggles are turned on. A minimap appears in the top-left corner.\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462150/extras_big/74f2e92d555d0cdb4081236cf583b176.avif?t=1768844896 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462150/extras/23d19ada21833d101b8d4c7f041fcf67.avif?t=1768844896\" alt=\"Peering over the player&#039;s gun sights during a foggy night in an abandoned city. A minimap appears in the top-left corner.\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462150/extras_big/23d19ada21833d101b8d4c7f041fcf67.avif?t=1768844896 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462150/extras/c6ecceac88057b0e11453e39bfddb43d.avif?t=1768844896\" alt=\"This developer didn&#039;t use generative AI.\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Well, That Wasn't Too Bad","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3462150/31c9e679021c8a0ad1f46cc35612a991804fd437.jpg"},{"name":"It\u2019s Our Job","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3462150/5bcbda070c871a8f18070cd829fe1c1f2844b44f.jpg"},{"name":"The Professionals","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3462150/a2558512342a76e864ab404b81318e4196822d72.jpg"},{"name":"Whoops...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3462150/2e149537ba38c29ff15bde2e2df4bde85def1805.jpg"},{"name":"I'm A Ghost In The City